# --- private material: never published ---
docs/private/

# --- corpus media: decoded frames and clips are never committed ---
frames/
clips/
cache/
*.mp4
*.mkv
*.h265
*.parquet

# --- results: small, checkable result JSONs are tracked; heavy intermediates are not.
